/T (Delinquency rates increased or remained flat across four of the five major property types, while retail fell sharply. Multifamily rose 35 basis points to 8.04%. Lodging rose 34 basis points to 6.18%, and office rose 16 basis points to 12.16%, both led by the new delinquencies described above. Industrial was unchanged at 1.14%. Retail fell 62 basis points to 6.58% on the mall cures.  )
/E (Delinquency rates increased or remained flat across four of the five major property types, while retail fell sharply. Multifamily rose 35 basis points to 8.04%. Lodging rose 34 basis points to 6.18%, and office rose 16 basis points to 12.16%, both led by the new delinquencies described above. Industrial was unchanged at 1.14%. Retail fell 62 basis points to 6.58% on the mall cures.  )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [8]
>>
